          "impact": "Task 1.1 requires test evidence for 'all four limitation classes,' but the spec delta names only three coverage limitation classes by name: `declared-deferral`, `containment-boundary`, and `unclassified`. The fourth class is not enumerated in the spec's Charter-based approach acceptance requirement or its blockers scenario, leaving one required test case without a spec-derivable definition and preventing independent verification that the test suite is complete.",
